# ==============================================================================
# Apka Bill (Orion POS) — Frontend Environment Template
# ==============================================================================
# Vite loads:
#   - `npm run dev:frontend`     -> .env.development.local -> .env
#   - `npm run build` / Capacitor -> .env.production        -> .env
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RUN COMMANDS (run from /Users/ayush/Code/ApkaBill/orion-pulse)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ONE COMMAND (Auto-starts Postgres + Backend :8080 + Frontend :8081):
#   npm run dev
#
# Production Backend Start (Auto-starts Postgres):
#   npm start
#
# Builds & Capacitor:
#   Web Production Build:          npm run build:frontend
#   Capacitor Android Sync:        cd frontend && npm run cap:sync
#   Capacitor Local Emulator Sync: cd frontend && VITE_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8080 npm run cap:sync
#   Android Debug APK:             cd frontend/android && JAVA_HOME="/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk@21/libexec/openjdk.jdk/Contents/Home" ./gradlew assembleDebug --no-daemon
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEV LOGIN CREDENTIALS (Local Dev / Seeded DB)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Org Admin ID / Email:  admin@orion.com
# Org Admin Password:    admin123
# Super Admin IDs:       superadmin@apkabill.com  (or superadmin@orion.com / superadmin)
# Super Admin Password:  SuperAdmin@123           (dev default when SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD unset)
#
# ==============================================================================
# 1. INTERNAL ENV (Local Machine / Emulator / LAN Device Testing)
# ==============================================================================
# Local Web browser (vite dev -> backend on localhost:8080):
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080

# Android Emulator -> host machine port 8080 (uncomment for local emulator APK):
# VITE_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8080

# Physical Android Phone on same Wi-Fi (replace with your Mac LAN IP):
# VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.1.100:8080

# ==============================================================================
# 2. EXTERNAL ENV (Live Cloud API / Production Web & Play Store Capacitor APK)
# ==============================================================================
# VITE_API_URL=https://orion-pos-api.ayushpalworkplace2006.workers.dev

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STORAGE & POSTGRESQL NOTE
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend Web & Capacitor store offline data/queue in local IndexedDB + localStorage.
# Primary data (PostgreSQL DATABASE_URL) & media uploads (Local Disk or Cloudinary)
# live in `backend/.env` (see `backend/.env.example`).
#   Start Local Postgres: brew services start postgresql@17  (or postgresql@18)

# Build mode flag (automatically set by `npm run build:capacitor`):
# CAPACITOR_BUILD=1
